        "summary": "Solid-state PL at 445 nm (λex 360 nm) from AC ligand transitions; 98.10% intensity drop after 360-nm irradiation for 150 min with complete luminous-color loss. χT = 55.15 cm3 mol−1 K at 300 K (expected 56.68 for 4 DyIII), decreasing to 37.35 at 2 K; M = 21.13 Nβ at 50 kOe and 2 K. No frequency-dependent ac susceptibility before irradiation (no SMM). Photochromism: new UV-vis band at 530 nm; yellow to brown under Xe lamp.",
